*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...               CB008533 (5GC002640 left over) Extended Inter band DL FDD + TDD FR1 CA up to 4CCs (FDD as PCell)
...
...               The purpose of this test is to check the successful activation of FDD + TDD FR1 Classical Fullstack SA DL CA
...               up to 3CCs(FDD as PCell) with NRRELs pointing to 2 FDD and 2 TDD FR1 cells without gNB restart
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Reach a cell setup state, and perfom basic tests :
...                       Ue Register, CRNTI checks, ...
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : mame.diouf@nokia.com
...               Test Case Scenario contact  : mame.diouf@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation author : francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com
...               Test Case automation contact: francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 2022/01/31
...               Modified Date               : 2022/02/02
...               Last Modified by            : francois.tourlonnias@nokia.com

Resource          resources/robot/5GC002640_Keywords_fs_apovabio.robot
Resource          resources/robot/5GC002640_Config_Keywords.robot

Force Tags        CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM
...               PY36
...               SBTS00    SBTS23R1    SBTS22R4
# ...               CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_KLLL_SANSA_L1B_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD
# ...               CONFIGS_IBCA/5GC002640/custom_config_8533AB5.yaml
...               master_classicalbts_all
